# Media hosting (optional — the app bundles everything by default).
#
# Leave this unset and every image/sound/font is served from the app's own
# origin, hashed by Vite. That is the current setup and it works everywhere,
# including GitHub Pages.
#
# To serve media from Cloudflare later:
#   1. upload src/assets/** to an R2 bucket (or Images) keeping the folder shape
#   2. copy this file to .env.local and set the public base URL below
#   3. switch the imports in src/lib/assets.ts to the `remote()` helper
#
# VITE_ASSET_BASE_URL=https://media.example.com
